nsider the surface integral of the function \n$f(x,y,z)=2 x - y^{2} z$ \nover the parametric surface \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨3 u v,\\,- u,\\,2 u - 2 v^{2}⟩\n$$\n\nfor $(u,v)\\in D⊆{R}^{2}.$ What is the missing expression? Choose an integrand equal to the required expression as a function on $D$." :question/worked-solution "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3 u v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(- u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(2 u - 2 v^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3 v,\\,-1,\\,2⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3 u v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(- u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2 u - 2 v^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3 u,\\,0,\\,- 4 v⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 v & -1 & 2 \\\\ 3 u & 0 & - 4 v\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & - 4 v\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}3 v & 2 \\\\ 3 u & - 4 v\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}3 v & -1 \\\\ 3 u & 0\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4 v,\\,6 u + 12 v^{2},\\,3 u⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨4 v,\\,6 u + 12 v^{2},\\,3 u⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(4 v)^{2}+(6 u + 12 v^{2})^{2}+(3 u)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{45 u^{2} + 144 u v^{2} + 144 v^{4} + 16 v^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(2 x - y^{2} z)\\,{|}_{x=3 u v\\,y=- u\\,z=2 u - 2 v^{2}} \\\\  & =6 u v-1\\cdot (- u)^{2}\\cdot (2 u - 2 v^{2}) \\\\  & =- 2 u^{3} + 2 u^{2} v^{2} + 6 u v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,\\left(- 2 u^{3} + 2 u^{2} v^{2} + 6 u v\\right) \\sqrt{45 u^{2} + 144 u v^{2} + 144 v^{4} + 16 v^{2}}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["d30326ca-d748-58e4-a5fd-30f7dcf9dd69"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "9cc0030a-0473-5ca6-886a-e1f5a05cd61d" :answer/id #uuid "9cc0030a-0473-5ca6-886a-e1f5a05cd61d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\left(- 36 u^{3} + 36 u^{2} v^{2} + 2 u v\\right) \\left(13 u^{2} + 16 u v^{2} + 16 v^{4} + 144 v^{2}\\right)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0d456bb7-3a9d-56dd-93b0-7a184a9a4649" :answer/id #uuid "0d456bb7-3a9d-56dd-93b0-7a184a9a4649" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 36 u^{3} + 36 u^{2} v^{2} + 2 u v" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fe35efa1-95dd-5d26-a0cd-9af6226ea03d" :answer/id #uuid "fe35efa1-95dd-5d26-a0cd-9af6226ea03d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\left(36 u^{3} + 36 u^{2} v^{2} + 2 u v\\right) \\sqrt{13 u^{2} + 16 u v^{2} + 16 v^{4} + 144 v^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "23028f52-cd66-57e0-afed-a3ec494e3381" :answer/id #uuid "23028f52-cd66-57e0-afed-a3ec494e3381" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\left(- 36 u^{3} + 36 u^{2} v^{2} + 2 u v\\right) \\sqrt{13 u^{2} + 16 u v^{2} + 16 v^{4} + 144 v^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7194190b-9e89-5f7e-af91-ce99d3f01169" :answer/id #uuid "7194190b-9e89-5f7e-af91-ce99d3f01169" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\left(36 u^{2} v^{2} + 2 u v\\right) \\sqrt{13 u^{2} + 16 u v^{2} + 16 v^{4} + 144 v^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1f22210f-68bc-50f9-9ee4-c533602be0ab" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f22210f-68bc-50f9-9ee4-c533602be0ab" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["9cc0030a-0473-5