\\\  & =\\sqrt{(12 v)^{2}+(2 u + 4 v^{2})^{2}+(3 u)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{13 u^{2} + 16 u v^{2} + 16 v^{4} + 144 v^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(2 x - 2 y^{2} z)\\,{|}_{x=u v\\,y=- 3 u\\,z=2 u - 2 v^{2}} \\\\  & =2 u v-2\\cdot (- 3 u)^{2}\\cdot (2 u - 2 v^{2}) \\\\  & =- 36 u^{3} + 36 u^{2} v^{2} + 2 u v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,\\left(- 36 u^{3} + 36 u^{2} v^{2} + 2 u v\\right) \\sqrt{13 u^{2} + 16 u v^{2} + 16 v^{4} + 144 v^{2}}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["1f22210f-68bc-50f9-9ee4-c533602be0ab"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "84163230-7c82-51e8-9aea-9ae368f14f75" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186172130.py"} [:db/add 17592186172130 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186172130 :knowledge-point/questions ["1d9ba2e0-102f-5ae7-abb7-4c8e12292bfc" "2c8c277a-d40b-52fe-8295-ceb48a2d895c" "7d206b38-df94-5588-845c-04813c06e146" "69ca8999-9b1e-5bfc-ab7f-c561489f836e" "3b4808cc-728c-55b7-90f8-734ae2943c4e" "9b0c0134-9edd-51ff-b844-c0de83e1869b" "9d4bdd51-e427-51d6-919e-7d7980cc59de"]} [:db/ensure 17592186172130 :knowledge-point/validate]]
